data.json in this folder is a Derivative Database of the Banco Central do Brasil
"Estatísticas do Pix" open data (https://dadosabertos.bcb.gov.br/dataset/pix),
which the BCB publishes under the Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL)
v1.0. This derivative is likewise made available under the ODbL v1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

It joins, per município, Pix sent by pessoas físicas (QT_PagadorPF,
QT_PES_PagadorPF, VL_PagadorPF) for twelve closed months with names and 2026
population estimates from IBGE (agregado 6579, cited as source), and the
latest national MED figures from the BCB "Estatísticas de Fraudes no Pix"
(same licence). It is produced by labs/scripts/pix-na-minha-cidade.ts; see
BRIEF.md for the method.
